.TP
.B lk ollama host local
Return to localhost.
.TP
.B lk ollama host NAME URL
Save and select a host.
.TP
.B lk ollama host forget NAME
Forget a host.
.TP
.B lk ollama share
Share local Ollama privately through Tailscale Serve.
.TP
.B lk ollama share status
Show share/proxy status.
.TP
.B lk ollama share off
